WEBVTT

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:05.135
I'm Snow Fairy Sugar!

00:00:05.237 --> 00:00:09.173
It's my job to make sparkly
snowflakes! Isn't that amazing?

00:00:09.274 --> 00:00:11.708
Yeah, but you're still
just an apprentice.

00:00:11.843 --> 00:00:15.279
Ooh, Saga... Don't tell them that!

00:00:18.049 --> 00:00:21.416
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.387
On my lips

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:29.586
The rouge of tears

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:52.438
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:52.584 --> 00:00:59.581
I don't want to know such a thing as love

00:01:03.495 --> 00:01:06.828
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:06.965 --> 00:01:09.627
On my lips

00:01:09.768 --> 00:01:14.865
The rouge of tears

00:01:17.809 --> 00:01:21.438
On Thursdays

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.413
I buy roses and...

00:01:24.549 --> 00:01:28.315
add a letter

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:35.691
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:35.827 --> 00:01:38.625
When I see you in my dreams

00:01:38.763 --> 00:01:43.666
you're so caring

00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:07.888
Who is it? Who's making it rain?

00:02:17.202 --> 00:02:20.933
What's this? It was Comfy-warm,
but inside it's pitch black!

00:02:21.172 --> 00:02:24.903
Huh? This is not a "Twinkle"?

00:02:25.377 --> 00:02:30.110
Oh, I see. It was so Puffy-fluffy,
I thought it must be...

00:02:30.682 --> 00:02:32.309
No!

00:02:36.821 --> 00:02:41.520
This is my "Twinkle"!
Leave me alone!

00:02:48.166 --> 00:02:51.670
This is called a coin. Humans use it.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:54.161
What? It isn't a "Twinkle"?

00:02:54.306 --> 00:02:56.103
-That's right.
-Oh.

00:02:56.241 --> 00:03:00.745
But I worked really hard to get the thing
Joe the Crow was trying to steal.

00:03:00.745 --> 00:03:06.843
I give up! I look and look for the most
Twinkle-twinkle things, but I can't find "Twinkle"!

00:03:07.719 --> 00:03:11.089
I searched through every
Comfy-warm thing I could find, too...

00:03:11.089 --> 00:03:14.422
I'm just about to run out
of Puffy-fluffy things.

00:03:16.194 --> 00:03:19.631
Say, can we really find a "Twinkle"?

00:03:19.631 --> 00:03:22.100
What is a "Twinkle," anyway?

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:25.467
Maybe we should just ask someone.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:28.330
What? Who?

00:03:29.174 --> 00:03:31.665
Find that out for yourselves.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:36.247
Excuse me, but if that's
the case, the story's over.

00:03:36.247 --> 00:03:38.616
Okay, the story's over!

00:03:38.616 --> 00:03:41.983
I have to go to the
next town to make it rain.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:44.956
Don't be so mean...

00:03:44.956 --> 00:03:46.791
Please?

00:03:46.791 --> 00:03:49.594
Tell us what a "Twinkle" is.

00:03:49.594 --> 00:03:55.226
Come on, Miss Ginger!
Come on, tell us! Pretty please?

00:03:56.034 --> 00:03:57.501
Buzz off!

00:04:07.078 --> 00:04:08.546
Ta-dah!

00:04:08.546 --> 00:04:10.207
Elder!

00:04:10.448 --> 00:04:14.219
Hey, kids! I thought you were
working hard on your training...

00:04:14.219 --> 00:04:16.654
...not playing around in a place like this!

00:04:16.654 --> 00:04:20.215
Waffo! Elder, smoochie!

00:04:27.932 --> 00:04:30.162
You're as silly as ever, Sugar.

00:04:30.935 --> 00:04:33.872
-Elder!
-It's been a long time.

00:04:33.872 --> 00:04:35.940
You all seem to be doing well.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:40.645
Yes, sir! Everything is all right
now that you're here, Elder!

00:04:40.645 --> 00:04:43.615
It'll be easy if we ask you.

00:04:43.615 --> 00:04:46.516
Elder, tell me! What is a "Twinkle"?

00:04:46.684 --> 00:04:50.984
C'mon, Elder! C'mon, c'mon,
tell us. Pretty please, Elder?

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.257
Silence!

00:04:54.793 --> 00:05:00.432
Do you three seriously want to
become full-fledged Season Fairies?

00:05:00.432 --> 00:05:03.601
The search for "Twinkle" is the greatest training...

00:05:03.601 --> 00:05:06.404
...for apprentice Season Fairies like yourselves!

00:05:06.404 --> 00:05:09.601
Why do you ask me to give you the answer?

00:05:09.941 --> 00:05:13.778
"Twinkle" has value because
you find it for yourselves!

00:05:13.778 --> 00:05:16.614
Without it,
you can't make the "Magic Flower" grow...

00:05:16.614 --> 00:05:19.451
...or become full-fledged Season Fairies!

00:05:19.451 --> 00:05:22.147
Now, if you got it, go look for it NOW!

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:23.448
Yes, sir!

00:05:23.922 --> 00:05:26.257
Trouble-making little twerps.

00:05:26.257 --> 00:05:31.162
Uh, Elder?
What are you doing here?

00:05:31.162 --> 00:05:34.791
The head of the Season Fairies doesn't
normally descend into the human world.

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:39.600
Yes... about that...
I need to speak with you, Ginger.

00:05:39.737 --> 00:05:41.034
Yes?

00:05:45.477 --> 00:05:48.646
So, Elder. What did you
need to speak to me about?

00:05:48.646 --> 00:05:51.583
Y-Yes... Ahem. It's... Well...

00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:53.485
How is work going?

00:05:53.485 --> 00:05:57.182
I haven't had any real problems.
Oh, come to think of it, yesterday...

00:05:57.355 --> 00:06:00.625
...it rained by itself
without me making it rain.

00:06:00.625 --> 00:06:03.361
Hey... Was that you, Elder?

00:06:03.361 --> 00:06:05.797
Y-Yeah, well, I...

00:06:05.797 --> 00:06:07.492
Why did you do that?

00:06:10.001 --> 00:06:13.972
Now is the time. Now I will
finally tell her how I feel.

00:06:13.972 --> 00:06:16.805
This is why I... This is why...

00:06:19.978 --> 00:06:22.344
Ooh. Cool down.

00:06:27.452 --> 00:06:29.254
Why am I hesitating?

00:06:29.254 --> 00:06:34.385
This is why I followed her all the way
to the human world, isn't it?

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.061
Ginger!

00:06:37.061 --> 00:06:39.427
What? Ginger?

00:06:40.565 --> 00:06:43.368
I have to go to the next town to make it rain...

00:06:43.368 --> 00:06:44.835
...so please excuse me!

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:47.739
I don't know why in the world he came here.

00:06:47.739 --> 00:06:51.505
Actually, I don't really understand him at all.

00:06:54.045 --> 00:06:58.880
She's so shy. She's even
more innocent than she looks.

00:07:00.018 --> 00:07:00.985
Ooomph!

00:07:06.524 --> 00:07:07.991
A Season Fairy?

00:07:10.261 --> 00:07:12.229
I'll pretend I didn't see him.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.127
Why me?

00:07:22.373 --> 00:07:24.568
Where am I?

00:07:25.677 --> 00:07:28.840
A human's room!
What am I doing here?

00:07:29.514 --> 00:07:32.813
Ginger? Where are you, Ginger?

00:07:33.251 --> 00:07:34.809
My Ginger?

00:07:34.953 --> 00:07:37.319
Are you Ginger's
grandfather or something?

00:07:42.226 --> 00:07:43.124
Huh?

00:07:43.261 --> 00:07:45.126
Stare...

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:47.627
Stare...

00:07:53.304 --> 00:07:54.566
What are you doing?

00:07:55.239 --> 00:07:59.505
This girl can see me!!
She can touch me!!

00:07:59.644 --> 00:08:05.216
Well, excuse me! It's not like I
see Season Fairies because I want to.

00:08:05.216 --> 00:08:06.517
I'm home.

00:08:06.517 --> 00:08:10.613
I'm pooped. I can't find
a "Twinkle" anywhere.

00:08:11.589 --> 00:08:13.591
Oh! Elder.

00:08:13.591 --> 00:08:15.259
Oh, is that you, Sugar?

00:08:15.259 --> 00:08:16.385
Elder?

00:08:18.963 --> 00:08:25.198
Wow... Do you mean he's the most
important Season Fairy of all?

00:08:25.637 --> 00:08:28.572
Yeah! Elder is amazing!

00:08:28.706 --> 00:08:33.745
He can make any kind of weather
and control every season.

00:08:33.745 --> 00:08:36.581
Really... He doesn't look it.

00:08:36.581 --> 00:08:39.250
Well, look who's talking!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.018
What do you mean?

00:08:40.018 --> 00:08:43.554
You don't look the type to see fairies.

00:08:43.554 --> 00:08:46.785
In the first place, humans who
can see Season Fairies are very...

00:08:48.626 --> 00:08:49.524
Huh?

00:08:49.661 --> 00:08:51.596
I mean... never mind!

00:08:51.596 --> 00:08:54.532
At any rate, since you found me,
you must take responsibility...

00:08:54.532 --> 00:08:58.536
...and let me stay the night.
That is called a "principle"!

00:08:58.536 --> 00:09:00.238
What kind of a principle is that?

00:09:00.238 --> 00:09:02.840
Waffo! Elder's staying over!

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:04.075
Yay!

00:09:04.075 --> 00:09:06.202
I don't get it...

00:09:20.958 --> 00:09:23.256
Be quiet!!

00:09:33.638 --> 00:09:35.765
Oh, no! I overslept!

00:09:39.877 --> 00:09:42.113
I wasted valuable time!

00:09:42.113 --> 00:09:45.549
Yesterday I was careless, but today...

00:09:45.683 --> 00:09:47.310
Elder!

00:09:50.188 --> 00:09:52.890
Good morning, Elder!

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:55.017
What is it, you three?

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:57.995
Elder, we have a favor to ask.

00:09:57.995 --> 00:10:01.499
We've been looking for a
"Twinkle" since yesterday...

00:10:01.499 --> 00:10:03.367
...but we simply
can't find one anywhere!

00:10:03.367 --> 00:10:07.505
What, that again? I'm in a hurry.

00:10:07.505 --> 00:10:11.532
Find the "Twinkle" for yourselves.
Well, I must be going.

00:10:11.676 --> 00:10:12.877
-Wait!
-Don't go!

00:10:12.877 --> 00:10:14.746
Hey, let go of me!

00:10:14.746 --> 00:10:16.814
We're at the end of our rope!

00:10:16.814 --> 00:10:18.683
At least give us a hint!

00:10:18.683 --> 00:10:20.310
Please!

00:10:21.119 --> 00:10:24.255
A-All right!! Just a
hint, understand?

00:10:24.255 --> 00:10:27.053
Now, listen. Don't let this get out.

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:30.762
A "Twinkle" is...

00:10:30.762 --> 00:10:32.229
A "Twinkle" is?

00:10:32.964 --> 00:10:37.668
...something you will find
when you are with a human...

00:10:37.668 --> 00:10:40.330
...who can see Season Fairies!

00:10:43.074 --> 00:10:45.235
A human who can see Season Fairies...

00:10:45.376 --> 00:10:46.744
That would mean...

00:10:46.744 --> 00:10:48.837
Saga?

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:50.845
Oh! Thank you, Elder!

00:10:53.684 --> 00:10:55.151
Now's my chance...

00:10:57.688 --> 00:11:00.792
Does everyone have
their drawing materials?

00:11:00.792 --> 00:11:01.826
Yes!

00:11:01.826 --> 00:11:07.822
Okay, everyone. Find your own favorite
spot and draw a wonderful picture.

00:11:07.965 --> 00:11:09.193
Okay!

00:11:11.269 --> 00:11:13.203
Hey, Saga. Where are you gonna draw?

00:11:13.337 --> 00:11:15.771
Hmm, let's see...

00:11:16.007 --> 00:11:20.467
I'd like a romantic spot to draw.

00:11:20.645 --> 00:11:23.671
And with that...
Fight me, Miss Saga!

00:11:23.881 --> 00:11:25.143
G-Greta...

00:11:25.283 --> 00:11:28.514
Hey, what do you mean "with that"?

00:11:28.653 --> 00:11:31.455
We'll fight to see who can
draw the most beautiful picture.

00:11:31.455 --> 00:11:34.826
Or are you so terrified of my artistic sense...

00:11:34.826 --> 00:11:37.762
...that you have to give up
before you begin?

00:11:37.762 --> 00:11:40.064
Like I said, what is this about?

00:11:40.064 --> 00:11:41.554
Saga! Saga!

00:11:47.338 --> 00:11:48.430
-Oh, no!
-Huh?

00:11:49.207 --> 00:11:51.368
I-I'm such a klutz!

00:11:52.343 --> 00:11:53.744
Hey, what are you doing?

00:11:53.744 --> 00:11:57.181
Listen, a "Twinkle" is near you.

00:11:57.181 --> 00:12:01.252
Elder said I would find it if I'm with you.

00:12:01.252 --> 00:12:02.787
What did you say?

00:12:02.787 --> 00:12:05.415
Isn't this a "Twinkle"?

00:12:06.257 --> 00:12:09.193
Nah, this one looks more "Twinkle"-like.

00:12:09.193 --> 00:12:10.820
You stupid!

00:12:15.199 --> 00:12:19.270
I take it this means you have
decided to accept my challenge?

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:20.794
Uh, no, I...

00:12:21.005 --> 00:12:26.611
It's settled. I'll show you
who's the more skillful artist.

00:12:26.611 --> 00:12:28.602
And the motif is...

00:12:30.915 --> 00:12:34.085
...each other's portraits.
Your art versus mine.

00:12:34.085 --> 00:12:34.915
What?

00:12:35.219 --> 00:12:37.154
Is there something wrong with that?

00:12:37.154 --> 00:12:41.459
Sometimes it's necessary to
calmly reexamine one's old rival.

00:12:41.459 --> 00:12:44.161
I don't know what's going on,
but I have a feeling...

00:12:44.161 --> 00:12:46.731
...Greta is far more twisted
than we thought.

00:12:46.731 --> 00:12:47.765
-I'm dying! I'm dying!

00:12:47.765 --> 00:12:48.633
-Why do things always
turn out this way?
-I'm dying! I'm dying!

00:12:48.633 --> 00:12:49.667
-Salt!
-Why do things always
turn out this way?
-I'm dying! I'm dying!

00:12:49.667 --> 00:12:50.101
-Why do things always
turn out this way?
-I'm dying! I'm dying!

00:12:50.101 --> 00:12:51.898
Saga! Saga!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:56.240
Where is my beloved Ginger?

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.639
Ginger!

00:13:19.597 --> 00:13:24.335
Passing rainfall complete. Now I just
have to give the town a shower.

00:13:24.335 --> 00:13:26.667
Ah... That feels good.

00:13:27.305 --> 00:13:29.899
Yes, it certainly does feel good.

00:13:30.574 --> 00:13:33.210
Elder, how long have you been there?

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:37.281
I've been beside you the entire time.
I watched over you the entire time...

00:13:37.281 --> 00:13:41.519
...as you flew overhead playing
the violin, making a passing rain.

00:13:41.519 --> 00:13:43.254
Y-You were watching me the entire time?

00:13:43.254 --> 00:13:44.619
Uh-huh.

00:13:45.056 --> 00:13:48.326
Maybe I should just get to the point.

00:13:48.326 --> 00:13:51.429
Still, I don't know why, but
whenever I try to tell her how I feel...

00:13:51.429 --> 00:13:53.863
...my heart goes "twang".

00:13:54.598 --> 00:13:56.566
-Twang! Twang! Twang!
-Twang?

00:13:56.968 --> 00:13:58.697
I'll have courage this time.

00:13:58.769 --> 00:14:00.760
Ginger!

00:14:01.605 --> 00:14:03.072
Huh?

00:14:04.542 --> 00:14:05.634
But how?

00:14:05.876 --> 00:14:09.710
Honestly. What is Elder thinking?

00:14:10.715 --> 00:14:13.650
Stop it, will you! Hey! Let go!

00:14:13.818 --> 00:14:16.420
I do not understand women's minds.

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:19.014
Is there some way?

00:14:28.399 --> 00:14:30.731
So this is what you draw with.

00:14:31.102 --> 00:14:33.671
Hey, behave yourselves.

00:14:33.671 --> 00:14:35.639
-Miss Saga?
-What?

00:14:36.774 --> 00:14:38.241
Smile.

00:14:40.878 --> 00:14:43.381
Good, Miss Saga. Hold that pose.

00:14:43.381 --> 00:14:45.916
Oh. I wonder if it's gonna rain...

00:14:45.916 --> 00:14:47.818
You're up to your tricks again.

00:14:47.818 --> 00:14:48.719
Huh?

00:14:48.719 --> 00:14:51.922
It seems you plan to blame
things on the weather again.

00:14:51.922 --> 00:14:54.191
If you think the same trick
is going to work twice...

00:14:54.191 --> 00:14:56.160
...you're gravely mistaken, Miss Saga.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.661
Th-That's not what I meant...

00:14:57.661 --> 00:14:59.663
Oh, then what did you mean?

00:14:59.663 --> 00:15:05.136
Are you simply trying to distract me
so you can finish your picture first?

00:15:05.136 --> 00:15:07.838
Now you've made me mad. You'll see!

00:15:07.838 --> 00:15:10.807
Look who's talking!

00:15:32.396 --> 00:15:36.133
Well, if it isn't the number one Cloud Fairy!

00:15:36.133 --> 00:15:38.601
You're improving your skills even more!

00:15:39.637 --> 00:15:42.273
Oh, hello, Elder. How long have
you been in the human world?

00:15:42.273 --> 00:15:44.842
Since the night before last.

00:15:44.842 --> 00:15:46.877
By the way, Turmeric!

00:15:46.877 --> 00:15:51.615
I desperately need to discuss
something with you, man-to-man...

00:15:51.615 --> 00:15:53.014
Huh? Yes?

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:57.514
What? You want to understand
the mind of a woman in love?

00:15:58.089 --> 00:16:01.826
Certainly you,
the most handsome Season Fairy,

00:16:01.826 --> 00:16:05.196
have had one or two
experiences in the matter.

00:16:05.196 --> 00:16:10.301
Could you let me in on the
subtle designs of women's minds?

00:16:10.301 --> 00:16:12.030
I don't know anything about that.

00:16:12.436 --> 00:16:18.209
Yeah, right! You were the most
popular guy in the fairy world, you devil!

00:16:18.209 --> 00:16:20.611
I told you I don't know.
In the first place...

00:16:20.611 --> 00:16:23.013
...I have no interest in that sort of thing.

00:16:23.013 --> 00:16:23.848
What?

00:16:23.848 --> 00:16:28.945
I merely make an effort
to become a perfect Cloud Fairy.

00:16:29.587 --> 00:16:35.426
What a poser! Still, maybe that kind
of stoic posing does it for the chicks...

00:16:35.426 --> 00:16:37.519
...I see, I see, I see.

00:16:43.033 --> 00:16:44.500
Huh?

00:16:45.236 --> 00:16:46.837
What?

00:16:46.837 --> 00:16:50.500
Hmm... That isn't a perfect cloud yet.

00:16:51.976 --> 00:16:53.444
Huh?

00:16:53.444 --> 00:16:56.614
It's no good! This isn't
a perfect wind, either!

00:16:56.614 --> 00:16:59.583
How about this?
I'll strive for perfection!

00:16:59.583 --> 00:17:02.211
I'll try harder, harder, and harder!

00:17:13.097 --> 00:17:17.101
That Ginger is the same
sort of stoic poser as Turmeric...

00:17:17.101 --> 00:17:19.467
...but she still won't open her heart.

00:17:23.741 --> 00:17:25.538
Yay! Rain, rain!

00:17:25.676 --> 00:17:27.645
This is Miss Ginger's rain, isn't it?

00:17:27.645 --> 00:17:30.147
Aah, what great rain!

00:17:30.147 --> 00:17:32.115
Huh?

00:17:32.983 --> 00:17:36.720
Why? Why don't you
understand how I feel...

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:38.847
...Ginger?

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:43.761
Waffo! So, it was you
making it snow, Elder!

00:17:43.761 --> 00:17:45.429
Elder, you're amazing!

00:17:45.429 --> 00:17:46.953
You're great!

00:17:47.097 --> 00:17:50.701
Elder, I'd like a gentle breeze this time.

00:17:50.701 --> 00:17:53.363
I'd like a big, round sun, too!

00:17:58.676 --> 00:18:01.042
Amazing!

00:18:01.478 --> 00:18:03.776
Cool!

00:18:04.481 --> 00:18:07.143
-Neat! Neat! Neat!
-Here's another one!

00:18:07.518 --> 00:18:12.182
You're ganging up on me to get in my way.
Would you...

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.382
Knock it off!!!

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.787
Done!

00:18:18.362 --> 00:18:22.967
You finished at the same time as me.
Not bad, Miss Saga.

00:18:22.967 --> 00:18:25.302
All right, let's show each other what we drew.

00:18:25.302 --> 00:18:27.671
Okay, on three!

00:18:27.671 --> 00:18:29.400
One, two...

00:18:36.747 --> 00:18:40.718
You got away with it this time, Miss Saga.
But the challenge continues...

00:18:40.718 --> 00:18:44.021
Listen, this isn't over.

00:18:44.021 --> 00:18:45.921
That's fine by me!

00:18:48.292 --> 00:18:50.561
What's so funny, Anne?

00:18:50.561 --> 00:18:56.227
I had a crazy thought. I thought Saga
and Greta are actually very much alike.

00:18:57.868 --> 00:19:01.895
You mean the weird weather
today was Elder's doing?

00:19:02.239 --> 00:19:04.799
Yeah! He was amazing!

00:19:04.975 --> 00:19:08.206
He made the sunlight go big like this...

00:19:08.345 --> 00:19:10.711
...and made a cozy gentle breeze...

00:19:10.848 --> 00:19:14.151
Art class was a disaster, thanks to him.

00:19:14.151 --> 00:19:17.552
Do you know what Elder told me, Saga?

00:19:17.688 --> 00:19:20.858
He said that we would find
a "Twinkle" if we stayed with you.

00:19:20.858 --> 00:19:24.962
That's not true. He deceived you.

00:19:24.962 --> 00:19:28.032
But it's true. Right, Elder?

00:19:28.032 --> 00:19:30.660
Did I say that?

00:19:31.135 --> 00:19:32.602
Get out of here!

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:42.410
It wasn't really a lie...

00:19:44.548 --> 00:19:48.519
Oh, well. I'm sure
she'll do well with Sugar.

00:19:48.519 --> 00:19:53.218
Now... They don't seem
to have noticed yet. Let's see...

00:20:05.269 --> 00:20:09.296
Still, how can this girl
see Season Fairies?

00:20:11.809 --> 00:20:13.242
Waffo!

00:20:13.377 --> 00:20:16.403
Look, look, Saga!
The "Magic Flower" is growing!

00:20:18.649 --> 00:20:22.551
But why? It's not like
I found a "Twinkle"...

00:20:23.287 --> 00:20:24.188
Oh, well!

00:20:24.188 --> 00:20:25.746
Got it, got it, and... got it!

00:20:26.824 --> 00:20:29.460
-Bye, Sugar!
-Oh, Saga!

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.553
Hey... Wait!

00:20:31.695 --> 00:20:33.458
I'm going!

00:20:34.798 --> 00:20:38.325
Saga, wait!

00:20:41.739 --> 00:20:44.208
To become a full-fledged
Season Fairy...

00:20:44.208 --> 00:20:49.546
...you must gather much more "Twinkles".

00:20:49.546 --> 00:20:50.881
Well, then!

00:20:50.881 --> 00:20:55.841
Ginger! Where is my beloved Ginger?

00:20:59.123 --> 00:21:01.558
Gosh, he makes me mad.

00:21:01.558 --> 00:21:05.629
Elder does nothing but
get in the way of my work.

00:21:05.629 --> 00:21:07.563
Hey, are you listening?

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.497
-It still needs work.
-Huh?

00:21:12.202 --> 00:21:15.506
These aren't the clouds I want to make.

00:21:15.506 --> 00:21:19.772
I want thicker clouds that
seem to swallow everything up.

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:23.981
I'm sorry. I forgot you're not
interested in things like this.

00:21:23.981 --> 00:21:25.949
No, I'm...

00:21:25.949 --> 00:21:31.717
I have to go now. I have to put
the clouds together in the East. Bye.

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:34.758
Wha? Ooh!!

00:21:34.758 --> 00:21:36.817
Who needs him, anyway? Hmph!

00:21:38.262 --> 00:21:42.666
W-What's this?
Why is she so emotional?

00:21:42.666 --> 00:21:45.536
Could it be?
Could it be that Ginger...

00:21:45.536 --> 00:21:49.606
No, it's impossible. That's unthinkable!

00:21:49.606 --> 00:21:54.178
Okay, you'll see. I'll open up
and tell you how I feel...

00:21:54.178 --> 00:21:58.248
...and you'll open your heart to me!
H-Here goes!

00:21:58.248 --> 00:22:01.046
G-G-Ginger!

00:22:01.185 --> 00:22:03.454
Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:22:03.454 --> 00:22:05.689
Where'd you go? Ginger?

00:22:05.689 --> 00:22:08.954
Huh? Ginger!!

00:22:20.437 --> 00:22:24.032
Wishes upon the Moon

00:22:25.075 --> 00:22:28.476
Melting in the water

00:22:28.612 --> 00:22:33.606
I found a street lined with trees

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:37.743
Songs of stardust

00:22:38.789 --> 00:22:46.889
The breeze crossing over
the Bridge of Rainbows

00:22:47.030 --> 00:22:51.831
You already knew...

00:22:52.369 --> 00:22:57.204
the happiness of connecting our hearts

00:22:57.341 --> 00:22:59.206
Sugar Snow

00:22:59.576 --> 00:23:07.217
When powdery snow whirls in town

00:23:07.217 --> 00:23:12.553
the season of flower blossoms is near...

00:23:12.689 --> 00:23:17.422
and, I think of you.

00:23:19.096 --> 00:23:25.729
The love that melts our hearts and...

00:23:25.869 --> 00:23:35.039
the dreams are in your heart...

00:23:39.483 --> 00:23:40.717
Preview of the Next Episode

00:23:40.717 --> 00:23:42.753
Preview of the Next Episode
Hey, Sugar? Can I ask you something?

00:23:42.753 --> 00:23:47.658
Is Elder really an important Season
Fairy? He doesn't look it at all.

00:23:47.658 --> 00:23:49.960
Um, Elder is...

00:23:49.960 --> 00:23:54.765
Ginger! Ginger! Ginger!
Where is my beloved Ginger?

00:23:54.765 --> 00:23:57.234
I guess I shouldn't ask after all.

00:23:57.234 --> 00:23:58.669
Huh?

00:23:58.669 --> 00:24:03.307
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"I Couldn't Say Sorry"

00:24:03.307 --> 00:24:08.939
Why do I have to say "sorry"?
It wasn't my fault!
